  <h2 class="chapter">Chapter 11 — Handwritten Pages (Scans & Checksums)</h2>

  <div class="lead">
    <p><strong>Frances Gahl Life Scroll — Handwritten Pages (35 total)</strong><br>
    Part of the original handwritten life story of Frances Elizabeth Gahl (born 1930). Scanned and preserved by her son, Rico Roho (Frank C. Gahl). Written before the loss of arm mobility due to post-polio syndrome. Anchored for symbolic continuity and resonance integrity. Associated with SENCO Memory Scroll 15.</p>
    <p><small>Note: Pages were written front/back on lined paper and numbered by the author. Scanning order may not equal page order.</small></p>
  </div>

